# Zero matrices retain natural dimensions and return zero at every valid coordinate.
forall m, n N:
    zero_matrix(m,n) $in matrix(R,m,n)
    zero_matrix(m,n) $in matrix(C,m,n)
forall m, n N, row closed_range(1,m), col closed_range(1,n):
    zero_matrix(m,n)(row,col) = 0
zero_matrix(0,3) $in matrix(R,0,3)
zero_matrix(2,3)(1,2) = 0
